  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1205.07 Emissions Testing and Monitoring Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1205.07 Emissions Testing and Monitoring Requirements. A source subject to this chapter shall comply with the applicable testing requirements as listed for each source category pursuant to Env-A 804. When compliance with the applicable emission standards is achieved by using a capture and control system, a capture efficiency test shall be performed according to the procedures in Env-A 805.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1200.html"
}
